WEBVTT

00:00:03.220 --> 00:00:10.370
Import: PDF, Word, Excel or CSV, PowerPoint, web pages - and OneNote notebooks.

00:00:10.370 --> 00:00:18.480
Pick the file - several at once is fine.

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:26.690
Then the topic: any parent, sub-topic or child topic, or a new one on the spot.

00:00:26.690 --> 00:00:34.820
Headings, lists, tables, pictures and formatting arrive as blocks; page breaks become sections.

00:00:34.820 --> 00:01:05.000
An Excel workbook: every worksheet becomes a Spreadsheet page - dates, numbers and formula results as Excel shows them.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:15.140
A PDF stays viewable at the top of its page; its text and pictures are lifted out below it, page by page.

00:01:15.140 --> 00:01:24.710
A PowerPoint deck: one page, every slide its own section - with the speaker notes.

00:01:24.710 --> 00:01:30.200
Problems are reported, nothing is lost quietly. The originals are never changed.

